WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.789 --> 00:00:05.940
At least 22 people have died and reports say
a dozen are missing in southern India after

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.540
heavy rains caused flash floods and landslides.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:14.110
The Indian Army has sent teams to help the
rescue operation in the coastal state of Kerala.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.340
Thousands of people have been forced from
their homes.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:24.630
The Kerala state government says over a hundred
relief camps have been set up.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:30.530
A human chain passes the bodies pulled from
the mud.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:36.950
The heavy rains in the Indian state of Kerala
started on Friday and caused landslides.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:44.510
Forcing thousands to flee to safety as the
mudslides swallowed homes and loved ones.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:48.510
"The hill broke off near us.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.350
There has been a lot of damage and loss.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:52.400
The house has gone.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.400
Children have gone.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.480
All that has happened.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:01:03.130
The water entered our homes - that’s when
they moved us."

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:07.540
The Indian Airforce had to use helicopters
to reach some affected areas which were cut

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:13.060
off completely by road.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:18.930
Swollen rivers, swept away houses, built too
close to their banks.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:24.640
Building and development over wetland and
forest areas has made the state more vulnerable

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:31.360
to flooding.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:41.380
And as waters subsided, local people were
distraught at the damage.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:43.310
"It was my livelihood.

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:45.090
Everything is gone.

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:49.600
Look everything is gone."

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:55.650
In another town nearby, a shopkeeper struggled
to salvage what he could from his spoiled

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:58.560
goods.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:08.629
"We managed to save some vegetables like onions
but most of our vegetables have been destroyed."

00:02:08.629 --> 00:02:17.980
The Indian government has deployed the military
to help with the relief operations and promised

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:21.859
to provide all possible support to help people
in need.

